[00:58.56]The people that watched the people that lied
[01:06.22]那些目睹谎言的人  
[01:06.22]Will tremble and fall crushed by their own pride
[01:14.61]将在自己的傲慢中颤抖倒下  
[01:14.61]Where there was silence and nothing in my arms
[01:22.02]曾经只有沉默和无尽的空虚  
[01:22.02]Now there's only rage and shadows of harm
[01:32.03]如今只剩下愤怒与伤害的阴影  
[01:32.03]I cry to the sky but the sky doesn't hear
[01:39.75]我向天空呼喊 但天空却无动于衷  
[01:39.75]I'm here mourning all that I once held most dear
[01:48.16]我在这里哀悼曾经最珍爱的一切  
[01:48.16]Fear pain rage and power
[01:55.90]恐惧 痛苦 愤怒与力量
[01:55.90]I'll bring flames of fire
[02:04.32]我将带来烈焰之火
[02:04.32]It's time to pray
[02:08.07]是时候祈祷了
[02:08.07]It's time to pay
[02:16.15]是时候偿还了
[02:16.15]I'll wash your sins away
[02:29.01]我将洗净你的罪恶
[02:29.01]Away
[02:52.65]洗净
[02:52.65]I cry to the sky but the sky doesn't hear
[02:58.85]我向天空呼喊 但天空却无动于衷  
[02:58.85](Fear pain rage and power)
[03:00.40]（恐惧、痛苦、愤怒与力量）
[03:00.40]I'm here haunted by all I once held most dear
[03:07.45]我在这里，被曾经最珍视的一切所困扰
[03:07.45](I'll bring flames of fire)
[03:08.70]（我将带来火焰）
[03:08.70]Beneath all this grief
[03:11.01]在这悲伤之下
[03:11.01](The thunder roars)
[03:12.05]（雷声轰鸣）
[03:12.05]There's a fire below
[03:14.66]火焰在深处燃烧
[03:14.66](The lightning strikes)
[03:16.33]（闪电划过）
[03:16.33]A heart made of vengeance a strike in the storm
[03:21.033]一颗复仇的心在风暴中发出打击
